Title: ADMIRAL BYRD: BEYOND THE ICE
Credit: Written by
Author: Zac Lester
Draft date: Zac's rewrite - Opening, draft 1 - 18 November 2026

EXT. ANTARCTICA - SUNSET

SUPER: "ANTARCTICA - 1934"

Byrd is alone in the vast Antarctic winter. He has episodes of violent COUGHING.

He is outside, cooking a large piece of red meat on the fire. It is sunset, and getting dark quickly.

He takes the food off and eats it, facing the unknown sunset.

A little FLICKER on the horizon appears, just as the AURORA comes.

Byrd looks startled, a tad uncertain. But in his eyes you can see he wants to return to conquer the unknown.

The desolate, endless landscape, as his remoteness sinks in.

CUT TO:

> ADMIRAL BYRD: BEYOND THE ICE <
